                            <div class="kdm-step-num">1</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Plan Your Livestream Content &amp; Hook</h4>
                                <p>Structure your broadcast: unboxing, live demo, flash sale, or Q&amp;A. Prepare a strong hook in the first 10 seconds to captivate cold viewers entering from sponsored feeds.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">2</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Create a Campaign in Meta Ads Manager</h4>
                                <p>Select your objective. Choose <strong>Sales</strong> for live shopping and ecommerce checkouts, or <strong>Leads / Engagement</strong> for webinar registrations and consultant enquiries.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">3</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Configure Pre-Stream or Mid-Stream Delivery</h4>
                                <p>You can schedule the live ad campaign in advance to build launch momentum, or launch the ad unit mid-stream once the broadcast begins trending with high engagement.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">4</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Select Live Broadcast as Your Creative Asset</h4>
                                <p>At the Ad level, choose the active livestream or scheduled live event. For creator collaborations, enable Partnership Ads and select the creator's live stream identity.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">5</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Define Your Audience &amp; Advantage+ Targeting</h4>
                                <p>Set geographic radius, age, and interest affinities. Use broad targeting or Lookalike Audiences with Meta Advantage+ algorithms so the system rapidly finds active viewers during the live window.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">6</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Select Placements (Stories, Reels &amp; Feed)</h4>
                                <p>Ensure Instagram Stories, Instagram Reels, Instagram Feed, and Facebook Feed placements are active so the stream renders across vertical video formats.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">7</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Allocate Budget for Concentrated Delivery</h4>
                                <p>Set a lifetime or accelerated daily budget aligned with your broadcast duration. Avoid underspending during the live window so the auction can deliver impressions rapidly.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">8</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Add Action-Oriented Call-to-Action (CTA)</h4>
                                <p>Select CTAs like "Watch Live", "Shop Live Offer", or "Book Session". Pin featured catalog products for instant 1-tap browsing during the stream.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">9</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Publish &amp; Monitor Real-Time Metrics</h4>
                                <p>Monitor live concurrent viewers, comment velocity, and cost per click. If delivery lags, adjust audience breadth or increase bid pacing while the stream is active.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="kdm-step-item">
                            <div class="kdm-step-num">10</div>
                            <div class="kdm-step-content">
                                <h4>Repurpose Replay into Evergreen Video Ads</h4>
                                <p>Once the livestream concludes, repurpose the top-performing segment into standard Reels and feed ads to continue driving conversions at minimal cost.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
