                            <ul style="margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #78350f; font-size: 14.5px;">
                                <li><strong>Broadcasting Without a Structured Script:</strong> Aimless talking loses cold viewers within seconds.</li>
                                <li><strong>Targeting Ultra-Narrow Audiences:</strong> Extremely small audiences throttle ad delivery during short live windows.</li>
                                <li><strong>Ignoring Ad Policy Guidelines:</strong> Live streams boosted with ad spend must strictly obey Meta advertising policies (no false claims, no prohibited products).</li>
                                <li><strong>Neglecting Live Comment Moderation:</strong> Always assign a team moderator to answer queries, pin links, and remove spam in real time.</li>
