                    <div id="costs" class="scroll-target" style="margin-top: 35px;">
                        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            How Much Do Meta Live Video Ads Cost?
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Live Video Ads participate in the standard Meta ad auction. Pricing depends on target location, audience competition, broadcast quality, and season (such as festive Q4 peaks).
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Rather than evaluating cost purely on Cost Per Mille (CPM) or Cost Per Click (CPC), evaluate <strong>Cost Per Converted Order</strong> and <strong>Return On Ad Spend (ROAS)</strong>. Because live streams accelerate conversion velocity, total customer acquisition costs (CAC) often end up lower than standard cold video funnels.
                        </p>
