                                    <h3 class="kdm-faq-question"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" style="color:#0284c7; margin-right:6px;"></i> 10. Do Live Video Ads guarantee more sales?</h3>
                                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer">No marketing format guarantees sales. Conversion rates depend on your product demand, the compelling nature of your live offer, host charisma, targeting precision, and checkout ease.</p>
                                </div>
