                            <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                                <div class="kdm-faq-header" onclick="toggleFaqItem(this)">
                                    <h3 class="kdm-faq-question"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" style="color:#0284c7; margin-right:6px;"></i> 11. Why did Meta take so long to launch this?</h3>
                                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer">Live content is unpredictable and difficult to moderate in real time. Meta had to engineer automated compliance review systems, dynamic auction delivery algorithms, and integrated live shopping infrastructure.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                                <div class="kdm-faq-header" onclick="toggleFaqItem(this)">
                                    <h3 class="kdm-faq-question"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" style="color:#0284c7; margin-right:6px;"></i> 12. Which country used live commerce first?</h3>
                                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer">China is widely recognized as the pioneer of live video commerce through platforms like Taobao Live and Douyin, followed by South Korea, Japan, and Southeast Asia.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                                <div class="kdm-faq-header" onclick="toggleFaqItem(this)">
                                    <h3 class="kdm-faq-question"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" style="color:#0284c7; margin-right:6px;"></i> 13. Are there rules for live ad content?</h3>
                                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer">Yes. All live broadcasts boosted as ads must strictly comply with Meta's Advertising Standards, avoiding misleading claims, prohibited substances, or guaranteed-outcome promises.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                                <div class="kdm-faq-header" onclick="toggleFaqItem(this)">
                                    <h3 class="kdm-faq-question"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" style="color:#0284c7; margin-right:6px;"></i> 14. How do I track results?</h3>
                                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer">Use Meta Ads Manager reporting along with the Meta Pixel and Conversions API to measure concurrent peak viewers, average watch time, cost per click, leads, purchases, and Return On Ad Spend (ROAS).</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                                <div class="kdm-faq-header" onclick="toggleFaqItem(this)">
                                    <h3 class="kdm-faq-question"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" style="color:#0284c7; margin-right:6px;"></i> 15. Should I use live ads together with regular ads?</h3>
